      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "§3Project Red Transportation§r adds a pipe-based routing network for items.\n\n- The §6Item Transport Pipe§r and the §6Pressure Tubes§r simply move items along.\n- §6Routed pipes§r form a smart network: an §6Interface Pipe§r next to an inventory makes it part of the network, a §6Request Pipe§r lets you request any item stored in the network, and a §6Crafting Pipe§r crafts missing items on demand.\n- Routed pipes are configured with §6Routing Chips§r, which are set up with the §6Router Utility§r.\n- §6Junction§r, §6Extension§r, §6Firewall§r, §6Valve§r and §6Latency§r pipes help to build and control bigger networks.\n\nIt is a good alternative to AE2 for item automation in the early and mid game.",
